  3. Submit it in Google Search Console / Bing Webmaster Tools.

  This mirrors the source site's own hand-maintained public/sitemap.xml
  (WordPress's built-in /wp-sitemap.xml already covers Pages/Posts
  automatically with no manual edits — this file exists to also cover the
